    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>SLEIGHT OF HAND</strong> is a hard-boiled, 3rd-person stealth action game of rain-slicked espionage action, where you infiltrate your old witch coven using a cursed deck of cards.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2857810/extras/aea8ee3782299f12ac232d059b4c49c5.poster.avif?t=1744238418\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2857810/extras/aea8ee3782299f12ac232d059b4c49c5.webm?t=1744238418\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>A NEW GENRE</strong> </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>SLEIGHT OF HAND</strong> is a <strong>STEALTH ACTION CARD-SIM</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sleight of Hand blends tactical card-based mechanics with real-time immersive stealth gameplay, offering a fresh take on both genres.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2857810/extras/3be85ad44d3a96d0cb09066f0c5a8524.poster.avif?t=1744238418\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2857810/extras/3be85ad44d3a96d0cb09066f0c5a8524.webm?t=1744238418\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2857810/extras/3be85ad44d3a96d0cb09066f0c5a8524.mp4?t=1744238418\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>WHAT MAKES THIS NEW GENRE COCKTAIL SO DELICIOUS?</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Think beyond traditional weapons. Use your deck of unique cards as the tools of your trade. Your approach\u2014silent infiltration, elaborate distractions, or something in-between\u2014is shaped by the cards you bring.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>CARDS ARE SPECIAL ABILITIES</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The special abilities you use are drawn from the cards in your deck. Cards allow you to <i>scout</i>, <i>teleport</i>, <i>set up traps</i>, <i>blind enemies</i>, and <i>interact with your environment</i> so that you can get in and out of each level without being seen.. unless you prefer the loud approach.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>STEALTH-ACTION SANDBOX</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore a living, nonlinear city where each infiltration is a puzzle of timing and creativity. Instead of strictly defined \u201clevels,\u201d you\u2019ll roam Steeple City\u2019s interconnected streets and alleys using smoke, misdirection, and quick thinking to turn complex encounters into clever triumphs.\u00a0</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>EXPERIMENTATION &amp; EXPRESSION</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Just like your favorite  card games, <strong>Sleight of Hand</strong> encourages you to experiment with card synergies. Whether you lure guards into <i>Honey Traps</i>, link multiple targets\u2019 fates, or vanish into mist at the perfect moment, the goal is to feel clever\u2014finding that perfect card combo to outwit and outmaneuver those on your tail.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2857810/extras/dde114b65c063444e175eeba1e20d3e6.poster.avif?t=1744238418\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2857810/extras/dde114b65c063444e175eeba1e20d3e6.webm?t=1744238418\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>PLAYER DRIVEN PROGRESSION</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Follow your own leads, find passwords in abandoned matchbooks, slip through hidden passages, and strike your old coven from unexpected angles. Adapt your route on the fly, reacting to the city\u2019s shifting patrols and secretive inhabitants. Over time, grow more powerful, find new strategies, and discover unexpected interactions.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2857810/extras/00f51bd12e0211c8d4a66359d1f81341.poster.avif?t=1744238418\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2857810/extras/00f51bd12e0211c8d4a66359d1f81341.webm?t=1744238418\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2857810/extras/00f51bd12e0211c8d4a66359d1f81341.mp4?t=1744238418\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>DYNAMIC ENCOUNTERS</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Encounters evolve as you do. The city draws from a pool of handcrafted scenarios, adapting to your deck, your past actions, and random elements. This ensures each infiltration feels fresh, reactive, and ripe for experimentation.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2857810/extras/d6b4489de0e9e6ea9cc2aaf40edd2d5d.poster.avif?t=1744238418\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2857810/extras/d6b4489de0e9e6ea9cc2aaf40edd2d5d.webm?t=1744238418\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2857810/extras/d6b4489de0e9e6ea9cc2aaf40edd2d5d.mp4?t=1744238418\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>UNFOLDING NARRATIVE</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect clues to locate your targets\u2014key members of the Hand\u2014and choose when and where to strike.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2857810/extras/d93d688ea02bacfb3aaf0cbbd2d2e4bc.poster.avif?t=1744238418\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2857810/extras/d93d688ea02bacfb3aaf0cbbd2d2e4bc.webm?t=1744238418\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2857810/extras/d93d688ea02bacfb3aaf0cbbd2d2e4bc.mp4?t=1744238418\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>MEET LADY LUCK</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Everyone\u2019s got an ex-employer they wished they never worked for. Not everyone\u2019s ex-employer set them up to take the fall. Step into the shoes of Lady Luck\u2014an occult detective pulled out of retirement for one final job\u2014 infiltrate the rain-soaked streets of Steeple City and bring down the powerful coven you once called family.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>When she finds out what her old coven is up to, they better hope they have a good hand. </strong>Lady Luck is voiced by Debi Mae West, <i>(Metal Gear Solid\u2019s Meryl Silverburgh)</i>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>  </strong>  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2857810/extras/81e2c36ee226573ddc14b4aa85c1011f.poster.avif?t=1744238418\" width=600 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2857810/extras/81e2c36ee226573ddc14b4aa85c1011f.webm?t=1744238418\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2857810/extras/81e2c36ee226573ddc14b4aa85c1011f.mp4?t=1744238418\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The cards told her this was coming.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>SLEIGHT OF HAND</strong> is a hard-boiled, 3rd-person stealth action game of rain-slicked espionage action, where you infiltrate your old witch coven using a cursed deck of cards.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2857810/extras/aea8ee3782299f12ac232d059b4c49c5.poster.avif?t=1744238418\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2857810/extras/aea8ee3782299f12ac232d059b4c49c5.webm?t=1744238418\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>A NEW GENRE</strong> </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>SLEIGHT OF HAND</strong> is a <strong>STEALTH ACTION CARD-SIM</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sleight of Hand blends tactical card-based mechanics with real-time immersive stealth gameplay, offering a fresh take on both genres.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2857810/extras/3be85ad44d3a96d0cb09066f0c5a8524.poster.avif?t=1744238418\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2857810/extras/3be85ad44d3a96d0cb09066f0c5a8524.webm?t=1744238418\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2857810/extras/3be85ad44d3a96d0cb09066f0c5a8524.mp4?t=1744238418\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>WHAT MAKES THIS NEW GENRE COCKTAIL SO DELICIOUS?</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Think beyond traditional weapons. Use your deck of unique cards as the tools of your trade. Your approach\u2014silent infiltration, elaborate distractions, or something in-between\u2014is shaped by the cards you bring.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>CARDS ARE SPECIAL ABILITIES</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The special abilities you use are drawn from the cards in your deck. Cards allow you to <i>scout</i>, <i>teleport</i>, <i>set up traps</i>, <i>blind enemies</i>, and <i>interact with your environment</i> so that you can get in and out of each level without being seen.. unless you prefer the loud approach.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>STEALTH-ACTION SANDBOX</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore a living, nonlinear city where each infiltration is a puzzle of timing and creativity. Instead of strictly defined \u201clevels,\u201d you\u2019ll roam Steeple City\u2019s interconnected streets and alleys using smoke, misdirection, and quick thinking to turn complex encounters into clever triumphs.\u00a0</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>EXPERIMENTATION &amp; EXPRESSION</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Just like your favorite  card games, <strong>Sleight of Hand</strong> encourages you to experiment with card synergies. Whether you lure guards into <i>Honey Traps</i>, link multiple targets\u2019 fates, or vanish into mist at the perfect moment, the goal is to feel clever\u2014finding that perfect card combo to outwit and outmaneuver those on your tail.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2857810/extras/dde114