laysinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2857810/extras/d6b4489de0e9e6ea9cc2aaf40edd2d5d.poster.avif?t=1744238418\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2857810/extras/d6b4489de0e9e6ea9cc2aaf40edd2d5d.webm?t=1744238418\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2857810/extras/d6b4489de0e9e6ea9cc2aaf40edd2d5d.mp4?t=1744238418\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>UNFOLDING NARRATIVE</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect clues to locate your targets\u2014key members of the Hand\u2014and choose when and where to strike.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2857810/extras/d93d688ea02bacfb3aaf0cbbd2d2e4bc.poster.avif?t=1744238418\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2857810/extras/d93d688ea02bacfb3aaf0cbbd2d2e4bc.webm?t=1744238418\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2857810/extras/d93d688ea02bacfb3aaf0cbbd2d2e4bc.mp4?t=1744238418\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>MEET LADY LUCK</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Everyone\u2019s got an ex-employer they wished they never worked for. Not everyone\u2019s ex-employer set them up to take the fall. Step into the shoes of Lady Luck\u2014an occult detective pulled out of retirement for one final job\u2014 infiltrate the rain-soaked streets of Steeple City and bring down the powerful coven you once called family.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>When she finds out what her old coven is up to, they better hope they have a good hand. </strong>Lady Luck is voiced by Debi Mae West, <i>(Metal Gear Solid\u2019s Meryl Silverburgh)</i>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>  </strong>  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2857810/extras/81e2c36ee226573ddc14b4aa85c1011f.poster.avif?t=1744238418\" width=600 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2857810/extras/81e2c36ee226573ddc14b4aa85c1011f.webm?t=1744238418\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2857810/extras/81e2c36ee226573ddc14b4aa85c1011f.mp4?t=1744238418\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The cards told her this was coming.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
